WEBVTT

00:03:56.524 --> 00:04:01.279
Relaxing, fun in the sun, freedom, baby.

00:04:01.279 --> 00:04:02.446
(Laughter)

00:04:02.947 --> 00:04:06.993
And for most folks, phase one lasts
for about a year or so.

00:04:07.368 --> 00:04:11.622
And then strangely,
it begins to lose its luster.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:14.709
We begin to feel a bit bored.

00:04:15.293 --> 00:04:17.962
We actually miss our routine.

00:04:18.296 --> 00:04:20.923
Something in us seems to need one.

00:04:21.549 --> 00:04:24.093
And we ask ourselves,

00:04:24.135 --> 00:04:27.054
"Is that all there is to retirement?"

00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:32.184
Now when these thoughts and feelings
start to bubble up,